  "totalBlocks": 118,
  "translatedBlocks": 109,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4c8cb794ba5d49b",
      "translationZh": "你已经把一切都准备好了——数据、模型，还有一套强劲的 GPU 配置。你点击“运行”，然后……等着。接着继续等。你的 GPU 几乎没怎么出力，而你的钱包却每小时都在缩水。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c1167ac5d7f2766",
      "translationZh": "听起来很熟悉？我们也经历过。在对 nanoVLM 项目做了一番侦查之后，我们发现，真正的罪魁祸首并不是模型或硬件，而是我们那条浪费极其严重的数据流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2621d7a01b1de39f",
      "translationZh": "以下是我们的发现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2482dbc7e4963834",
      "translationZh": "GPU 闲置：我们的模型真的就在干等着数据送过来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e67bb2a782568c13",
      "translationZh": "填充地狱：每个批次都塞满了毫无用处的填充 token，对训练没有任何贡献",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b445188b4dc3c354",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们将分五个阶段构建一条高效的流水线。每个阶段都会在上一步的基础上做些增减，并点评哪些做法奏效了，哪些没有。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d9406eaab2a5c4db",
      "translationZh": "目录：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd562b977e4d1694",
      "translationZh": "阶段 0：前置准备",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3678411f9af233bf",
      "translationZh": "阶段 1：数据集可视化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c86c59c52e32516",
      "translationZh": "阶段 2：朴素填充",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2be3df24ba60de42",
      "translationZh": "阶段 3：受约束的填充",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9d048f86336af1e",
      "translationZh": "阶段 4：利用背包算法更智能地打包",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44a953eea1fb1945",
      "translationZh": "阶段 5：用于多模态数据的背包算法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f4703a5c11dd9c3d",
      "translationZh": "[阶段 0] 准备工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eda6d1cf63d52a51",
      "translationZh": "为了让数据准备任务更容易理解和跟进，我们创建了一个独立的代码仓库，只专注于数据流水线。我们希望，相比阅读集成到 nanoVLM 仓库后的代码，这样会更容易理解。此外，这也可以帮助快速搭建其他数据流水线！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d463725c503013c",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/ariG23498/mmdp",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51440e9789b80206",
      "translationZh": "要跟着操作，你只需克隆该仓库。仓库包含最终的数据准备任务，但其设计旨在展示整个流程中的每一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2d7a4fffaeed54f0",
      "translationZh": "[阶段 1] 数据集可视化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38672eeb53ec0192",
      "translationZh": "在进行任何优化之前，我们需要了解自己要处理的内容。我们的多模态数据集包含图像、文本提示和回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a389e169debc01b",
      "translationZh": "熟悉训练数据是成功的关键。前面的脚本每次运行时都会展示一个随机样本；你可以将该片段复制到笔记本中，多运行几次，以便对数据形成直观认识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4e58fa6751a03e6c",
      "translationZh": "[阶段 2] 朴素填充",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8a886698ae72b2c",
      "translationZh": "我们第一次尝试训练时，采用了最直观（也非常常见）的方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1be75ed01d9234b4",
      "translationZh": "对所有内容进行词元化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb6b85dc738b2129",
      "translationZh": "找出每个批次中最长的序列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b9f4d71460065385",
      "translationZh": "对其余所有序列进行填充，使长度与之匹配",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "190289487abd6cf9",
      "translationZh": "结果令人痛心。看看这张可视化图：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2a72f272ec9c98e",
      "translationZh": "看到那些灰色区域了吗？那都是填充。也就是说，GPU 什么实质内容都没处理，你却还在为计算时间付费。我们每个批次大约有 60% 都浪费在了空 token 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2669fb5a42c609a3",
      "translationZh": "[阶段 3] 受限填充",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95d4607b97cfdb92",
      "translationZh": "我们接下来的做法很简单：设定一个全局最大长度，并严格遵守。如果某个样本太长，就直接丢弃。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "623e1577c954710c",
      "translationZh": "你可能已经注意到，现在这个批次少了一个样本。这是筛选过程造成的。这样做有所帮助，但我们仍然不考虑实际内容，把所有序列都填充到同一个固定长度。比之前好，但依然浪费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c189864743ba5240",
      "translationZh": "[阶段 4]：利用背包问题更智能地打包",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "241c6689decff4d3",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们准备好彻底重新思考批处理了。填充是我们的敌人，我们需要一种策略，尽量减少填充，同时尽可能增加每个批次能容纳的数据量。这时，计算机科学中的经典问题——背包问题——就派上用场了，它非常适合解决这个问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89b4487b854916ef",
      "translationZh": "想象一下，你正在为徒步旅行整理背包。它的承重有限，而你希望尽可能多地塞进有用的物品。在我们的场景中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f82bbe94bd88dc66",
      "translationZh": "背包就是一个训练批次，其 token 数量有上限（max_length）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88e7f29854be9f0b",
      "translationZh": "每件物品都是一个序列（经过分词的提示词与回答对），它的重量就是 token 数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce082ef334a9687f",
      "translationZh": "我们的目标是在不超过 token 数量上限的前提下，将尽可能多的序列装进批次，尽量减少空间浪费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be5b63b45c338e3b",
      "translationZh": "为了测试这个想法，我们先使用一个玩具数据集：一个仅包含 1 到 25 的数字列表，每个数字代表一个序列长度。这样，我们就可以进行实验，而不必处理图像和文本带来的复杂性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b5e2f0574556afc4",
      "translationZh": "切换到可迭代式数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddac0f1c8c8b16cf",
      "translationZh": "大多数 PyTorch 数据集都是映射式的（通过 dataset[i] 访问）。但对于动态批处理，我们需要更灵活的方式。因此，我们通过继承 torch.utils.data.IterableDataset 构建了一个可迭代式数据集。这样，我们就能即时生成批次，并实现一些技巧，比如将数据分片后分配给多个工作进程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "db2de9c13d859be7",
      "translationZh": "生产者—消费者模式的妙用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f08c29c65f79fd38",
      "translationZh": "序列打包可能很慢，尤其是在需要排序或打乱顺序时。为了让处理持续进行，我们使用基于 Python 队列的生产者—消费者模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f17e5c082b5451d",
      "translationZh": "生产者线程将数据打包成批次并放入队列，而主线程则按需从队列中取出这些批次。这种重叠执行让流水线保持顺畅运转。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5bfcf7c6899a52c8",
      "translationZh": "贪心打包",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbc981ceb0243479",
      "translationZh": "首先，我们尝试一种简单的贪心打包策略：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55c7179749877911",
      "translationZh": "这种方法按顺序遍历数据，不断向一个包中添加数据项，直到装满，然后再开始一个新包。它速度很快，但并不完美。生成的批次如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd215ecac4865018",
      "translationZh": "注意到后面的批次越来越稀疏了吗？我们留下了不少空隙。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3b1dfe64d8f1d336",
      "translationZh": "用装箱算法实现更紧凑的打包",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e7606b93662d0fe",
      "translationZh": "我们来试试更聪明的方法：装箱算法（具体来说，是首次适应递减算法）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88f1d3c30259760a",
      "translationZh": "这种方法按长度对序列排序（最长的排在最前面），然后尝试将每个序列放入第一个还有足够空间的包中。如果没有任何包能容纳它，就新建一个包。结果如何呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96f33f0c1b5638e3",
      "translationZh": "这些批次装得紧凑多了，浪费的空间也更少。就像用数据玩俄罗斯方块，把各个块严丝合缝地拼在一起。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5c60d70013879c65",
      "translationZh": "[阶段 5] 多模态数据的背包打包",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d65fbd9cb6e65fa",
      "translationZh": "现在进入正题，将背包打包方法应用到我们的多模态数据集上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "281dbdc308517a9c",
      "translationZh": "我们又回到了图像、提示词和回答上，需要在同时遵守 token 数量限制和图像预算的前提下，高效地将它们打包。设置图像预算是为了让各个样本的图像数量保持均衡。我们希望避免某个 GPU 需要处理的图像远多于另一个 GPU 的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9774fea7659c7ab",
      "translationZh": "我们新建的 ConstantLengthDataset 类承担了这些繁重的工作。与阶段 4 相比，它的工作方式如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54287be80625eb6d",
      "translationZh": "概念",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00f5a9168d715cdd",
      "translationZh": "阶段 4（玩具数据）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f2fe208b60cecb2",
      "translationZh": "阶段 5（多模态数据）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dbee4df6ea88ab3",
      "translationZh": "函数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "652bcc3a47842889",
      "translationZh": "条目",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9af8026d0523712f",
      "translationZh": "整数（序列长度）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a230a07773742b5",
      "translationZh": "完整样本（图像、提示词、回答）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81d27ef6d5033c3e",
      "translationZh": "权重",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cabb3f492ea0e06",
      "translationZh": "整数本身",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc861735c31c117c",
      "translationZh": "词元数量（len(input_ids)）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55e0b2a5d5249718",
      "translationZh": "背包",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb7c4a2d890ecb10",
      "translationZh": "一批整数，总和 ≤ max_length",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92cec0556562fd3c",
      "translationZh": "一批样本，满足 ≤ seq_length 及图像数量限制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cde3b3abb099cbed",
      "translationZh": "打包策略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef48ea707eccba89",
      "translationZh": "贪心或装箱",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f17fabcb92cf8195",
      "translationZh": "在词元和图像约束下进行贪心打包",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2bc09f6b42d095c",
      "translationZh": "生产者-消费者",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc9a9bf1c02174be",
      "translationZh": "生产者填充队列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc71eb840f75db46",
      "translationZh": "与简化示例相同，但使用多模态样本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d78d7ee35385da2",
      "translationZh": "样本过滤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1efdbdfbcd660680",
      "translationZh": "跳过 > max_length 的整数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a10648e0e8ce1d5c",
      "translationZh": "跳过 token 或图像数量过多的样本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18d5c33469224ffc",
      "translationZh": "分片",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa50bbf9197a5ae4",
      "translationZh": "拆分整数范围",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "430aeb531dc12db3",
      "translationZh": "对数据集索引进行分片",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cff7487911c2fce",
      "translationZh": "分批",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19487d07d14d17c7",
      "translationZh": "对整数进行分组",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c700d9852f6cbd00",
      "translationZh": "拼接并对齐词元/图像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2439bcb8dee14b6",
      "translationZh": "输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "804fe29206a319e7",
      "translationZh": "整数列表",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b91bc6c55f8e66e",
      "translationZh": "包含 input_ids、labels、attention_mask、images 的字典",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4207128b841e0430",
      "translationZh": "ConstantLengthDataset 完成所有这些操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1031a5730f805409",
      "translationZh": "读取样本（图像和文本）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5537ad8e88bdcad",
      "translationZh": "过滤掉长度过长或图像过多的样本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0b8869a3582278e",
      "translationZh": "使用贪心背包策略将样本打包成批次，兼顾词元数量和图像数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a76d8ae0c953233",
      "translationZh": "将最终批次填充到固定长度，但填充量比以前少得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35d49b869b92a4a7",
      "translationZh": "结果如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcf11e85ef0165bb",
      "translationZh": "瞧！灰色部分（填充）极少，批次里密密实实地装满了有用数据。这就像把行李箱收拾得井井有条，不用坐在上面也能拉上拉链。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfda2fd6932ad353",
      "translationZh": "这张图乍看之下可能不太直观，不过，让我们将它与受约束填充的图并排比较一下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55e0b2a5d5249718",
      "translationZh": "背包策略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea39975f597730fa",
      "translationZh": "受约束策略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2eef9658c66d78f",
      "translationZh": "在这里，你会注意到，背包中的样本分布更加均匀。我们也不会遇到因过滤而导致批次中样本数量减少的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8a104984aedad4d",
      "translationZh": "最初只是一次简单的“为什么训练这么慢？”的调查，最终却促使我们彻底重新思考处理多模态数据的方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3990ba77aa06155d",
      "translationZh": "数据流水线所采用的均衡背包策略，源自 NVIDIA 的论文《Eagle 2: Building Post-Training Data Strategies from Scratch for Frontier Vision-Language Models》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cce161f491db406d",
      "translationZh": "关键经验：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "184298c1255a822c",
      "translationZh": "将所有序列填充到最长序列的长度，是一个不错的初步方法（但会造成浪费）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e67dcb63e205a80",
      "translationZh": "将分批视为一个装箱问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "69fa32bce11114b1",
      "translationZh": "考虑所有约束条件（文本长度、图像内存占用等）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8bcdc29d6b8e5ff8",
      "translationZh": "先用玩具数据进行测试，以验证你的方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9cdb08e99254335",
      "translationZh": "想深入了解？请查看：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51689ddbe83266f3",
      "translationZh": "我们的 nanoVLM 博客文章",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1908739f1e809a1a",
      "translationZh": "此流水线的代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17a18fb7e1cc7f49",
